Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.88,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Ué? Aqui é...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.61,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,...a sala de aula?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:13.28,Black,G,0,0,0,,Boooom dia! Peace Peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:18.04,Black,G,0,0,0,,Bom, isto pode ser meio repentino,\Nmas eu prendi todas vocês nesta sala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:25.84,Black,G,0,0,0,,Para escapar, vocês precisarão engajar em um alegre trabalho em equipe e encontrar a saída.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:29.55,Black,G,0,0,0,,É hora de começar este excitante e divertido escape room! E foi dada a largada!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:29.72,Black,G,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 1590.67 916 l 1756 1016 1814.67 906.67 1585.33 824)}É hora de começar este excitante e divertido escape room! E foi dada a largada!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:29.88,Black,G,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 949.33 952 l 949.33 1061.33 54.67 1050.67 38.67 840)}É hora de começar este excitante e divertido escape room! E foi dada a largada!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:41.64,Black,El Condor Pasa,0,0,0,,Como que a gente vai escapar daqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:46.49,Black,Grass Wonder,0,0,0,,Esta imagem, sem tanuki? Não, não deve ser tão simples assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:49.82,Black,Grass Wonder,0,0,0,,Mas parece ser algo que ela faria...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.95,Black,El Condor Pasa,0,0,0,,Grass, você já descobriu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.95,Black,Grass Wonder,0,0,0,,Taempurnuki Tanuraki... Sem tanuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:56.73,Black,Grass Wonder,0,0,0,,Sem tanuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:01.67,Black,El Condor Pasa,0,0,0,,Você é incrível!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:09.72,Black,El Condor Pasa,0,0,0,,{\t(2074,2366,1,\c&H000000&)}G-grass...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.84,Black,King Halo,0,0,0,,Não está abrindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.85,Black,Seiun Sky,0,0,0,,O que a gente deve fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.50,Black,King Halo,0,0,0,,Será que esta porta é falsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:23.39,Black,King Halo,0,0,0,,E a chave para escapar está escondido em algum outro lugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.39,0:01:25.79,Black,Seiun Sky,0,0,0,,Ooooh, é mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:30.07,Black,Seiun Sky,0,0,0,,Realmente precisamos sair daqui...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:35.62,Black,King Halo,0,0,0,,Se decida se vai ficar acordada ou dormindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:35.62,Black,Seiun Sky,0,0,0,,— Vamos nos esforçaaar...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:40.85,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Não está dando certo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:41.62,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Spe-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.76,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Deixe comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:44.75,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Tsuru-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:47.21,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Aqui vou eu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:53.58,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Tsuru-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.26,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Me desculpa, Spe-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:58.49,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Já acabou... para mim...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:01.06,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,{\t(2297,2589,1,\c&H000000&)}T-tsuru-chaaaaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:05.23,Black,Yayoi Akikawa,0,0,0,,Tenso! Precisamos sair daqui rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:05.81,Black,Tazuna Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:21.79,Black,Gold Ship,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(982,40)}Barra de laços = Bond Gauge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:21.79,Black,Gold Ship,0,0,0,,Ótimo, ótimo! Continuem aumentando a barra de laços desse jeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:27.40,Black,Gold Ship,0,0,0,,Hm?
